<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND V PAKISTAN FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND V PAKISTAN FINAL TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
